>> title: Chimichurri
>> category: Dressings & Dips
>> tags: parsley, garlic, argentinian, sauce, no-cook
>> servings: 8
>> time: 45 min
>> step.1: dissolve
>> step.2: steep 10 min
>> step.3: stir in
>> step.4: whisk in, stand 30 min

Dissolve @kosher salt{1%tsp} in @red wine vinegar{1/4%cup}(60 mL) and @warm water{2%Tbs}.

Steep @garlic{4%cloves}(finely minced) and @red pepper flakes{1/2%tsp} in @&(~1)brine{} for ~{10%min}.

Stir @flat-leaf parsley{1%cup}(packed, finely chopped) and @dried oregano{1%Tbs} into @&(~1)brine{}.

Whisk @extra-virgin olive oil{1/2%cup}(120 mL) into @&(~1)herbs{} and let it stand ~{30%min} before serving.
